{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43240","headline":"题莹上人院 · 寇埴","name":"题莹上人院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舍筏求香偈，因泉演妙音。\n是明捐俗网，何独在山林。\n缭绕藤轩密，逶迤竹径深。\n爲传同学志，兹宇可清心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"寇埴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43240.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43240","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}